---
import BusinessPage from "../../components/business/BusinessPage.astro";
---

<BusinessPage
  title="关于 NewPlay"
  description="认识普莱和 NewPlay。从游戏里的陪伴，到音乐、AI 创作和社群共创，发现你的下一份好玩。"
>
  <div class="about">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-in">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">关于 NewPlay</p><span class="hero-signature"
            >NewPlay, Play New.</span
          ><h1>我们，<br />玩点新的。</h1><strong
            >新一代 AI Agent + GameFi + SocialFi<br />泛娱乐生态</strong
          ><p>
            从游戏里的陪伴，到社群里的共创。<br
            />让每一次好奇，都有新的打开方式。
          </p>
          <a href="#film" class="film-link"
            ><b>▶</b><span>看品牌影片<small>走进普莱的世界</small></span><i
              >↘</i
            ></a>
        </div>
        <div class="world">
          <span class="world-type">PLAY<br />NEW.</span><img
            src="/assets/plai-agent-transparent.png"
            width="430"
            height="665"
            alt="普莱张开双手欢迎你"
          /><span class="sticker">灵感，<br />不设限。</span><small
            class="world-caption">普莱 / 你的好玩同伴</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-foot">
        <span>游戏 · 音乐 · 创作 · 社群</span><a href="#film"
          >向好奇心出发　↓</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="ribbon">
      <span>把无聊，留在上一局。</span><b>✦</b><span>Play New.</span><b>✦</b
      ><span>下一段好玩，正在开场。</span>
    </div>
    <section class="dark film" id="film">
      <div class="biz-wrap">
        <div class="chapter-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">一部影片，一次新世界的开场。</p><h2>
              好玩，<br />先看见。
            </h2>
          </div><p>走进普莱的世界。<br />看游戏、音乐与灵感，如何相遇。</p>
        </div>
        <figure>
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            src="/assets/mv-poster.jpg"
            width="1920"
            height="1080"
            alt="品牌影片海报，普莱躺在蓝色光环中"
          /><button type="button" data-film
            ><b>▶</b><span>播放品牌影片<small>查看片源状态</small></span><i
              >↗</i
            ></button>
        </figure>
        <div class="under">
          <span>点击查看影片。</span><span>品牌概念影像 · 非游戏实机</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="dark meet" id="plai">
      <div class="biz-wrap chapter-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">普莱 AI Agent / 认识你的好玩同伴</p><h2>
            有点好奇。<br />有很多想象力。
          </h2>
        </div><p>✦　不只陪你聊聊。<br />　　 还想陪你，把想法玩出来。</p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <img
          loading="lazy"
          src="/assets/business/about-universe.webp"
          alt="普莱在游戏、音乐与创作的世界中"
          width="1440"
          height="804"
        /><figcaption>一个普莱，好多种可能。</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="biz-wrap meet-foot">
        <p>
          普莱是 NewPlay 的 AI 伙伴与品牌角色。<br
          />我们希望它陪你发现玩法、表达灵感，<br />也让每次参与多一点温度。
        </p><a class="biz-link" href="/studio/">和普莱试试创作　↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="directions" id="directions">
      <div class="biz-wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">从一个小游戏开始，走向一次创作、一场相遇。</p><h2>
          好玩，<br />不止一种形状。
        </h2>
        <div class="direction game">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">游戏</p><h3>下一局，<br />换个脑洞。</h3><p>
              轻量进入，发现熟悉玩法的新可能。<br
              />一张牌，一座塔，都能打开新的想象。
            </p><div class="game-links">
              <a href="/classic/">试试普莱牌桌　↗</a><a href="/lieflat/"
                >进入躺平发育　↗</a>
            </div>
          </div><figure>
            <picture
              ><source
                media="(max-width:760px)"
                srcset="/assets/business/about-game-mobile.webp"
              /><img
                loading="lazy"
                src="/assets/business/about-game.webp"
                alt="色彩缤纷的游戏世界概念图"
                width="613"
                height="500"
              /></picture
            ><figcaption>下一局<br />大有想象</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="music">
        <div class="direction biz-wrap">
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            src="/assets/business/about-music.webp"
            width="673"
            height="452"
            alt="普莱戴着蓝色耳机站在唱片上"
          /><div>
            <p class="eyebrow">音乐 / AI 创作</p><h3>
              让心情，<br />有自己的频率。
            </h3><p>
              从一句想法开始，把自己的风格带出来。<br
              />听见灵感，也让灵感被看见。
            </p><a class="biz-link" href="/studio/">去普莱工作室　↗</a><small
              >创作能力分阶段推进，当前为交互与视觉提案。</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="social">
        <div class="direction biz-wrap">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">社群 / 共创</p><h3>
              同频的人，<br />在这里相遇。
            </h3><p>
              让作品成为话题，让同好一起创造。<br />每个人的好奇，都值得被接住。
            </p><a class="biz-link" href="/cooperation/">一起创造　↗</a>
          </div><div class="social-art">
            <span>LET’S<br />PLAY.</span><img
              loading="lazy"
              src="/assets/business/about-social.webp"
              alt="普莱向伙伴们发出邀请"
            />
          </div>
        </div><p class="disclosure biz-wrap">
          产品能力分阶段推进。当前网站是品牌与交互原型，不代表全部服务已经上线。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="outro">
      <div class="biz-wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">NewPlay, Play New.</p><h2>
          把无聊，<br />留在上一局。
        </h2><a class="biz-link" href="/games/">发现你的下一份好玩　↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <dialog class="biz-dialog" aria-labelledby="film-state">
      <h2 id="film-state">NewPlay 品牌影片</h2><p>
        影片片源尚未接入。你可以先通过海报和下方的品牌故事认识普莱。
      </p><form method="dialog">
        <button class="biz-btn">返回品牌故事</button>
      </form>
    </dialog>
  </div></BusinessPage
>
<style>
  .about {
    color: #101d40;
    background: #dceaff;
  }
  .about h1,
  .about h2,
  .about h3 {
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }
  .about h1 {
    font-size: clamp(69px, 8vw, 116px);
    margin: 37px 0 28px;
  }
  .about h2 {
    font-size: clamp(54px, 6.8vw, 100px);
    margin: 26px 0 0;
  }
  .about h3 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 4.3vw, 62px);
    margin: 22px 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .hero,
  .social {
    background: #2854f7;
    color: white;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-in {
    max-width: 1420px;
    margin: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 43% 57%;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 42px 4% 18px;
    min-height: min(55vw, 780px);
  }
  .hero {
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero-signature {
    position: absolute;
    right: 5%;
    top: 18px;
    color: #d5e1ff;
    font:
      500 10px "NewPlay Space",
      sans-serif;
  }
  .hero-copy {
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-copy > strong {
    display: block;
    font:
      700 clamp(21px, 2vw, 30px) / 1.5 "NewPlay Space",
      "NewPlay Noto SC",
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .hero-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 20px 0;
    color: #e1eaff;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .film-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    border-block: 1px solid #8da8fc;
    padding: 13px 0;
    width: min(275px, 100%);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .film-link > b {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ffe347;
    color: #101d40;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 38px;
  }
  .film-link small,
  .film button small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .film-link i,
  .film button i {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .world {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 778/710;
    background: url("/assets/business/about-orbit.svg") center/100% 100%
      no-repeat;
  }
  .world-caption {
    position: absolute;
    right: 17%;
    bottom: 4%;
    color: #1b3673;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .world-type {
    position: absolute;
    left: 9%;
    top: 23%;
    font:
      900 clamp(52px, 8.8vw, 124px) / 0.88 "NewPlay Space",
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    color: #c8a61e99;
    transform: rotate(-17deg);
  }
  .world img {
    position: absolute;
    left: 31%;
    bottom: 3%;
    width: 57%;
    height: 94%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transform: rotate(9deg);
  }
  .sticker {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 28%;
    background: #dceaff;
    color: #2854f7;
    box-shadow: 4px 7px #172b84;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 13%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 21px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.15;
    transform: rotate(10deg);
  }
  .hero-foot {
    border-top: 1px solid #839cfa;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 5%;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .hero-foot a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .ribbon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(16px, 3.5vw, 58px);
    background: #ffe347;
    padding: 24px 15px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 29px);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .ribbon b {
    color: #2854f7;
  }
  .dark {
    background: #101d40;
    color: white;
  }
  .film,
  .meet {
    padding: 94px 0 56px;
  }
  .chapter-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 43px;
  }
  .chapter-head > p,
  .meet-foot p {
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #c3d4ef;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .film figure,
  .meet figure,
  .game figure {
    position: relative;
  }
  .film figure {
    border: 1px solid #4b6390;
  }
  .film figure > img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .film button {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    text-align: left;
    bottom: 9%;
    left: 3%;
    width: min(320px, 80%);
    border: 0;
    color: #101d40;
    background: #ffe347;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px #09152d88;
    padding: 18px 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .under {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #c3d4ef;
    margin-top: 13px;
  }
  .meet {
    border-top: 1px solid #35476a;
  }
  .meet h2 {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 5.2vw, 75px);
  }
  .meet figure > img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .meet figcaption,
  .game figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 8%;
    left: 7%;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
    font-weight: 800;
    background: #ffe347;
    color: #101d40;
  }
  .meet-foot {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
  .directions {
    padding-top: 94px;
  }
  .direction {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6%;
    padding: 60px 0;
  }
  .direction p:not(.eyebrow) {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .direction small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .directions .biz-link {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .game {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .game img,
  .music img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .game figcaption {
    color: white;
    background: #2854f7;
    left: 0;
    bottom: 4%;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px #9ab0df;
  }
  .game-links {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 25px;
    max-width: 300px;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .game-links a {
    display: block;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #90afd5;
    padding: 8px 0;
    color: #1d469b;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .music,
  .outro {
    background: #ffe347;
  }
  .social-art {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 500px;
    background: url("/assets/business/social-orbit.svg") center/contain
      no-repeat;
  }
  .social-art::after {
    content: "✦";
    position: absolute;
    right: 3%;
    top: 8%;
    color: #ffe347;
    font-size: clamp(55px, 6vw, 92px);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .social-art span {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 10%;
    font:
      900 clamp(60px, 7vw, 102px) / 0.9 "NewPlay Space",
      sans-serif;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b3c6ff66;
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
  }
  .social-art img {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10%;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 65%;
    height: 96%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transform: rotate(8deg);
  }
  .disclosure {
    border-top: 1px solid #6c8af5;
    padding: 18px 0;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .outro {
    padding: 70px 0 80px;
    background-image: url("/assets/business/about-star.svg");
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: 85% center;
    background-size: min(23%, 300px);
  }
  .outro .biz-link {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .about dialog h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1250px) {
    .music .direction {
      min-height: 582px;
      width: 96%;
      max-width: 1400px;
      gap: 5%;
    }
    .social .direction {
      min-height: 665px;
    }
    .game {
      min-height: 620px;
    }
    .about .outro {
      min-height: 487px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero-in {
      display: block;
      padding: 30px 22px 0;
    }
    .hero-copy {
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .hero-copy h1 {
      font-size: clamp(57px, 15vw, 84px);
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .hero-copy > strong {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
    .hero-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .film-link {
      padding: 6px 0;
      width: 220px;
    }
    .world {
      background-image: url("/assets/business/about-orbit-mobile.svg");
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 450px;
      aspect-ratio: 345/410;
      margin: -48px 0 -29px auto;
    }
    .world-type {
      font-size: 68px;
      top: 21%;
    }
    .world img {
      left: 18%;
      width: 77%;
      height: 95%;
    }
    .sticker {
      width: 17%;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .hero-foot {
      font-size: 8px;
      padding: 9px 5%;
    }
    .ribbon {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      padding: 12px 20px;
    }
    .film,
    .meet,
    .directions {
      padding: 47px 0 32px;
    }
    .chapter-head {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .chapter-head > p {
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .about h2 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 12.3vw, 70px);
      margin: 20px 0 0;
    }
    .film figure > img {
      aspect-ratio: 348/217;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .film button {
      left: 8px;
      bottom: 8px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .under {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .meet figure img {
      height: 350px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: 64%;
    }
    .meet figcaption,
    .game figcaption {
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 8px 15px;
    }
    .meet-foot {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 21px;
    }
    .meet-foot p {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .meet-foot .biz-link {
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    .directions {
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
    .direction {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }
    .direction h3 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 10vw, 48px);
    }
    .game {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .game-links {
      max-width: none;
    }
    .game figure {
      width: 90%;
      align-self: center;
    }
    .music .direction {
      width: 100%;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 26px 0;
    }
    .music .direction > div {
      padding: 0 23px 22px;
    }
    .social .direction {
      gap: 0;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
    .social-art {
      min-height: 385px;
      background-image: url("/assets/business/social-orbit-mobile.svg");
    }
    .social-art img {
      width: 84%;
    }
    .outro {
      padding: 52px 0;
    }
    .biz-wrap {
      width: calc(100% - 44px);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .hero-in {
      display: block;
      position: relative;
      padding: 0 22px;
      min-height: clamp(685px, 182.3vw, 750px);
    }
    .hero-copy {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .hero-copy .eyebrow {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 20px;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #d5e1ff;
    }
    .hero-signature {
      right: 0;
      top: 20px;
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .hero-copy h1 {
      margin: 0;
      padding-top: 60px;
      font-size: clamp(58px, 16.15vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: -0.064em;
    }
    .hero-copy > strong {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    .hero-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 13px 0 20px;
    }
    .film-link {
      width: 204px;
      min-height: 57px;
      font-size: 11px;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .film-link small {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .film-link > b {
      width: 29px;
      height: 29px;
      line-height: 29px;
    }
    .world {
      position: absolute;
      right: -1.5%;
      bottom: -22px;
      width: 88.5%;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: none;
    }
    .world img {
      left: 22.4%;
      width: 68.4%;
      height: 89%;
      bottom: 2.5%;
      transform: rotate(10deg);
    }
    .sticker {
      width: 16.2%;
      right: 7%;
      top: 27%;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .world-caption {
      bottom: 9%;
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .world-type {
      left: 8%;
      top: 28%;
    }
    .hero-foot {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0 22px;
      padding: 0;
      height: 58px;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }
</style>
<script>
  const film = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>(".about dialog")!;
  document
    .querySelector("[data-film]")!
